== Effects ==
* Grants +0.25 [[damage]] for every [[Health#Broken Hearts|broken heart]] Isaac has.
* Immediately grants 3 broken hearts.
** Every otherwise fatal hit will add 2 more, replacing other types of hearts if necessary, and activates {{i|The Necronomicon}}'s effect, dealing 40 damage to all enemies in the room.
** Once Isaac has no non-broken hearts left, he dies. Extra lives will apply at this point.

== Notes ==
* At the maximum of 11 broken hearts, Isaac gains a total of +2.75 damage.
* The effect does not save Isaac from fatal [[Devil deal]]s.
**However, while taking an item that costs heart/s and will result in death, if Isaac takes any damage, it will leave him on half a blue heart with taken item and will add 2 broken hearts.

== Synergies ==
* {{t|A Missing Page|r}} / {{I|Missing Page 2|r}}: Deals an additional +40 damage when Isaac dies. Effects stack together and with multiple copies.
* {{t|Found Soul}}: The ghost gains 2 extra hits per floor, and every hit they take will damage all enemies in a room as well.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Damocles}}: Heartbreak does not protect Isaac from Damocles.
* {{c|Keeper}}: Keeper will gain 1 broken heart instead of 3. Taking fatal damage will only grant Keeper 1 broken heart.
* {{C|Magdalene}} + {{I|Birthright}}: Can hold up to 17 broken hearts, totaling +4.25 damage instead.
* {{i|Plan C}} / {{p|Suicide King}}: Heartbreak does not protect Isaac from these effects.
* {{c|Tainted Eden}} / {{c|Tainted Isaac}}: The starting broken hearts are removed when Heartbreak is rerolled/dropped. However, any broken hearts gained from lethal damage will persist.
* {{C|Tainted Jacob}}: This effect will save Tainted Jacob while he is in his Lost form, adding two broken hearts to his regular health.
* {{C|Tainted Keeper}}: Tainted Keeper will gain 1 broken heart instead of 3. Taking any damage will kill him, as he will then have 2 broken hearts.
** {{t|Mother's Kiss}} can mitigate this as it gives Tainted Keeper an extra coin heart.
* {{c|The Lost}} / {{c|Tainted Lost}}: The Lost has full benefit of the item. This lets him survive 4 extra hits, each hit adding 1 damage, and the 5th is fatal.
** Tainted Lost can't normally obtain it, as it doesn't have the <code>offensive</code> item tag.
** '''The Lost''' / '''Tainted Lost''' + {{i|Magic Skin}} / {{p|VI - The Lovers?}}: No broken hearts are added by the item/card, thus having no effect on Heartbreak.

